{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202617sSg62vAQ1795846746.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>下周一是世界愛滋病日，衞生署一連兩日舉辦活動響應。</p><p></p><p>全球同抗愛滋病運動在觀塘海濱舉行，衞生署署長林文健等出席啟動禮。活動設戶外藝術展覽。署方期望透過藝術裝置、互動教育展板、手作工作坊等，讓公眾認識治療愛滋病發展及預防資訊等。</p><p></p><p>展覽一連兩日，由中午12時至晚上8時免費入場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.761313+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T05:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:33:59.030718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:33.923043+00:00","content_hash":"6891daddf8bdb0629fd07b07e953289cc8fefd2cf9dcce8db43c9cd0b462b5fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.761313+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}